# ArtCloset — Product Overview

**Version:** 1.0.0 (Free catalog + Premium VIP / Drive backup)  
**Category:** Offline-first personal art vault & catalog  
**Platform:** Android-first; iOS and web present in codebase (React Native / Expo)  
**Android package / iOS bundle ID:** `com.dukenizer.artcloset`  
**Scheme:** `artcloset`

**Roadmap:** [docs/ROADMAP.md](docs/ROADMAP.md) · **Monetization:** [docs/MONETIZATION-STRATEGY.md](docs/MONETIZATION-STRATEGY.md)

---

## Executive Summary

ArtCloset is a private, offline-first mobile application that helps artists and collectors **list, describe, and share** artworks without accounts or a required cloud.

The product thesis: **most makers and collectors do not need another social marketplace—they need a trustworthy personal vault that works offline, respects privacy, and stays fast on a phone.**

**Free** includes structured local storage (SQLite), managed artwork images, collections, search and filters, featured Home gallery, exhibit presentation, labels, share cards, buyer email, digital calling card, and explicit local metadata export. Catalog create/edit/search is never paywalled.

**Premium** (VIP tester codes now; store purchase later) unlocks **Google Drive backup & restore** so a reinstall or new phone can recover the full catalog (database + images) from the user’s private Drive app-data folder. ArtCloset never uploads in the background.

**Brand pillars:** *List · Describe · Share*  
**Tagline:** *Your art, offline first.*  
**Eyebrow:** *Your work. Your device.*

