## Monetization (summary)

| Tier | Access |
|------|--------|
| **Free** | Full local catalog, share, labels, calling card, JSON metadata export |
| **Premium (VIP code or future IAP)** | Google Drive backup & restore (`drive.appdata`); all `CAN_*` entitlements true for future features |

VIP1 = 3 months from activation · VIP2 = 6 months. Codes are one-time per device (offline). Expiry prompts redeem or purchase; ignoring keeps Free forever.

See [docs/MONETIZATION-STRATEGY.md](docs/MONETIZATION-STRATEGY.md).

---

## Limitations (Transparent)

1. **No live multi-device sync** — Drive is backup/restore, not continuous sync.
2. **Local JSON export ≠ full image backup.**
3. **VIP one-time is on-device only** — without a server, the same code can be used on another device.
4. **Store IAP not live yet** — Get Premium is a stub; VIP covers tester Premium.
5. **iOS media depth deferred**; web is not a production vault host.
6. **OAuth / Drive need a development or preview build** with Google client IDs configured.

